StudentStash
============

A no-jargon investing primer + personalized planner for students who don't
have much to invest. Aimed at high school and college users.

What's in here
--------------
- index.html — landing page, education cards, planner form, and common-mistakes section
- styles.css — dark, mobile-friendly styling
- app.js    — allocation logic, compound-growth projection, and tip generation

How to run
----------
No build step. Just open index.html in any browser:

  xdg-open index.html       # Linux
  open index.html           # macOS

Or serve locally:

  python3 -m http.server 8000
  # then visit http://localhost:8000

Disclaimer
----------
Educational only. Not financial advice. Return assumptions are rough
historical averages and not guarantees.
